  "generated_text": ".. **Rotation:**\n   - The complex number $-3 - 8i$ is rotated by $45^\\circ$ in the counter-clockwise direction.\n   - The rotation matrix for $45^\\circ$ is $\\begin{pmatrix} \\cos 45^\\circ & -\\sin 45^\\circ \\\\ \\sin 45^\\circ & \\cos 45^\\circ \\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix} \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\end{pmatrix}$.\n   - Applying this rotation matrix to $-3 - 8i$:\n     \\[\n     \\begin{pmatrix} \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix} -3 \\\\ -8 \\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix} \\frac{\\sqrt{",
